<title>UK: Caspian first half profits slip.</title>
<headline>Caspian first half profits slip.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>6 months to December 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		1.15 loss	    vs 1.09 loss</p>
<p> Operating profit	 0.7		    vs 0.97 loss</p>
<p> Pretax loss		2.27		   vs 1.21</p>
<p> Turnover		   12.46		  vs 1.88</p>
<p>NOTE - The figures are on a pro forma basis to reflect a full six months contribution from the purchase of Leeds United. Operating profit is before transfer fees and interest. The results included a profit on the disposal of children's television interests of 5.28 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Caspian Group Plc</p>
</text>
